	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "a821e1bf-58f3-4906-bb7d-855e6b321265",
		"name": "FITCHECK Shop - E-Commerce API Collection",
		"description": "# FITCHECK Shop API Collection\n\nKoleksi API profesional untuk **FITCHECK E-Commerce System** (Next.js App Router + Prisma + PostgreSQL + Midtrans Payment Gateway).\n\n## 🚀 Quick Start Instructions\n1. Import file `api.json` atau `fitcheck-shop.postman_collection.json` ke Postman.\n2. Pastikan server lokal Next.js running di `http://localhost:3000` (`npm run dev`).\n3. Variabel `baseUrl` bawaan adalah `http://localhost:3000`.\n4. Jalankan request secara berurutan atau gunakan Postman Collection Runner.\n\n## 📁 Daftar Endpoint & Modul\n- **Authentication**: Admin login (`POST /api/auth/login`)\n- **Products**: Management katalog produk (CRUD `GET`, `POST`, `PUT`, `DELETE`)\n- **Categories**: Mengambil daftar kategori unik produk (`GET /api/categories`)\n- **Search**: Auto-complete suggestion search bar (`GET /api/search/suggestions`)\n- **Orders**: Management pesanan & checkout Snap Midtrans (`GET`, `POST`, `PATCH`)\n- **Webhooks**: Midtrans payment status notification handler (`POST /api/webhooks/midtrans`)\n\n---",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
